   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "Which of the following could represent a population of bacteria, <span data-math=\"b\">b</span>, that decreases at a rate of <span data-math=\"\\frac18\">\\frac18</span> every hour, <span data-math=\"h\">h</span>? Consider an initial amount of 100 bacteria.",
